<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>iV3Xz</Major>
    <Description>Hello, Macroers!

Let's skip the pleasentries and get right to the macro.

As always, a few things to consider:
1) Have a magnetic ID. Please invest in one, as it will make everything easier. If you don't have it or don't want it, then please add a 4 to the macro on the first part so you can pick up the loot.
2) Have either a strong Digi with a good F1 so you can go farm anywhere, or if you don't, go to File Island Waterfront where you will be able to kill every digi with almost any F1. I recommend either Verdandi Terminal (Have an X-digi here) for X tickets, Yin Yang and seals; or Minato City for Witchmon seals, eggs and Teras.
3) Put DS disc on F5 and Health disc on F6

Now, considering the macro:
1) You will move. It is not for farming, it is to distract people from thinking you are macroing. The movement is subtle, just a little to the north, and then a little to the south.
2) If you have a strong digi, you may be able to change the F1 for a 1, so you auto attack digis. If you have an X digi and you do this, please change de DS disc for X-antibody so it doesn't devolve.

Good luck!</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 43 1
Delay 1 s
